====== Pine64 RockPro64 v2.1======
~~NOTOC~~

The Pine64 RockPro64 is a single-board-computer with a PCIe 4x connector, 6 ARM64 cores (4 little, 2 big), plenty of RAM and storage.

{{media:pine64:pine64-rockpro64-v2.1_pcb_top.jpg?400|RockPro64}}

