===== Basic configuration =====
After flashing, proceed with [[docs:guide-quick-start:ssh_connect_to_the_internet_and_install_luci|Basic configuration]]: Use SSH to connect to the internet and install Luci Web interface.
The RockPro64 can be reached under 192.168.1.1 with a subnet mask of 255.255.255.0.

===== Specific configuration =====

==== Network interfaces ====
The default network configuration is:
^ Interface Name   ^ Description                  ^ Default configuration    ^
| br-lan           | LAN | 192.168.1.1/24   |

===== Hardware =====
==== Info ====
^ Architecture     | ARM64                             |
^ Vendor           | Rockchip/Pine64                           |
^ Bootloader       | U-Boot                           |
^ System-On-Chip   | Rockchip RK3399   |
^ CPU/Speed        | 1800 MHz                          |
^ Flash-Chip       | SPI-NOR                           |
^ Flash size       | 16 MiB                            |
^ RAM              | 4096 MiB                           |
^ Ethernet         | 10/100/1000 Mbit/s w/ vlan support    |
^ USB              | 2x 2.0, 1x 3.0, 1x Type-C     |
^ Serial           | [[#Serial|Yes, 1500000 baud]]                  |
^ JTAG             | [[#JTAG|via SD card slot]]          |

